MMO-11643

The void of the pre-authorization should not be sent to IST/Clearing. The ODE_STAN field of the void and the STAN of the pre-authorization will be used to link the two transactions. Therefore, when processing the DCF file transactions to IST in the TC57 modules, it is necessary to add code that checks the original transaction. This can be done by using the reversal's ODE_STAN and the original's STAN to determine whether the original transaction is a pre-authorization (100 message) or a settled transaction (200). If it is a reversal of a 100 message, then do not include this reversal in the TC57. Please note, Reversal for pre-auth completion is still required to be sent to IST/clearing.




